From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] v2: add libmdbx DiskStateStore, flat-file block/undo stores,
 and runtime stores

Add the libmdbx-backed DiskStateStore for authenticated V2 UTXO state
and flat-file block/undo storage.
